Package: mint-radio
Version: 1.5.2
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-tk, mpv, gir1.2-xapp-1.0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Maintainer: Mint Radio <stuart@localhost>
Description: Low-memory internet radio player for Linux Mint
 Tiny Tkinter + mpv radio player (~55 MB while playing) with 40+
 bundled UK/US/IE stations, Shoutcast/Icecast directory scanning,
 presets, recording, sleep timer and minimize-to-tray.
